      "created_at": "2024-03-19T06:16:00.182Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello community, I need help understanding how to include a special tax, for the moment I can’t find a way of doing it with the system.</p>\n<p>Brief summary: In our country El Salvador, alcoholic beverages are subject to 2 specific taxes:</p>\n<p><strong>1)Alcoholic specific content tax (Alicuota)</strong> :** It’s a specific amount (not percentage) charged per each 1% of alcohol content per liter of alcoholic beverage. Each type of liquor has a particular tax amount per % of alcohol per litre of product.</p>\n<p>Example of Alcoholic content tax table:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/5/6584ce20fb15d3f2782bdd85e9ccdf758a4311df.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"eu4L0ZUgQVCKKZzaaYp6bNREMyP\" width=\"388\" height=\"99\"></p>\n<p>Example:<br>\nOne bottle of 750 ml vodka 40% alc/vol is subject to:</p>\n<p>[Alcohol %] x [Alicuota] x [volumen in liters]<br>\n40 x 0.09 x 0.75 = $2.70</p>\n<p><strong>2) Ad Valorem tax</strong> : The ad-valorem tax rate will be eight percent (<strong>8%</strong>).**</p>\n<p>This rate will be applied to:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>The <strong>suggested selling price to the public</strong>, declared by the producer or importer to the Tax administration.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The price differential, when alcoholic beverages are sold to the consumer at prices higher than those suggested to the public.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>If item is sold below the suggested price to public the differential (8%) will be awarded as credit for the next month declaration.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>From ERPNEXT point of view each item (Vodka, 40%, 750 ml) has specific details to correctly calculate the final tax and selling price.</p>\n<div class=\"md-table\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>ITEM NAME</th>\n<th>LUNA Basalto Vodka 750ml 40%</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Product type</td>\n<td>Vodka</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>% of alcohol</td>\n<td>40%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Volume</td>\n<td>750 ml</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Alicuota</td>\n<td>0.16</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Suggested retail price (without any taxes)</td>\n<td>12.50</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Selling price (without any taxes)</td>\n<td>(could be <strong>lower, equal or higher</strong> than suggested retail price)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div><p>Complete calculation of alcoholic beverage tax:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Case 1 (Selling price = Suggested retail price):</li>\n</ul>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/b/0bcce99a6b442c0a65dad19498566652fc93b50f.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/0bcce99a6b442c0a65dad19498566652fc93b50f\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/b/0bcce99a6b442c0a65dad19498566652fc93b50f_2_690x85.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"1Goh3TP0J8W5JSiOu8L5dWJitAz\" width=\"690\" height=\"85\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/b/0bcce99a6b442c0a65dad19498566652fc93b50f_2_690x85.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/b/0bcce99a6b442c0a65dad19498566652fc93b50f_2_1035x127.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/b/0bcce99a6b442c0a65dad19498566652fc93b50f_2_1380x170.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F3E0DE\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1858×231 22 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Case 2 (Selling price &gt; Suggested retail price):<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/9/09e8717c6b6724d230027132739065a886c446fa.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/09e8717c6b6724d230027132739065a886c446fa\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/9/09e8717c6b6724d230027132739065a886c446fa_2_690x86.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"1pEiTkKAQ8reLJDbcdKjBXy4QMG\" width=\"690\" height=\"86\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/9/09e8717c6b6724d230027132739065a886c446fa_2_690x86.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/9/09e8717c6b6724d230027132739065a886c446fa_2_1035x129.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/9/09e8717c6b6724d230027132739065a886c446fa_2_1380x172.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F3E0DE\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1856×234 22.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Case 3 (Selling price &lt; Suggested retail price):<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/d/ad103fc5f7be87b7de8fdfb11aa6deae4d6116ff.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/ad103fc5f7be87b7de8fdfb11aa6deae4d6116ff\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/d/ad103fc5f7be87b7de8fdfb11aa6deae4d6116ff_2_690x87.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"oGZpMVHX9M7vOlJfhO5GosdUTeL\" width=\"690\" height=\"87\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/d/ad103fc5f7be87b7de8fdfb11aa6deae4d6116ff_2_690x87.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/d/ad103fc5f7be87b7de8fdfb11aa6deae4d6116ff_2_1035x130.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/d/ad103fc5f7be87b7de8fdfb11aa6deae4d6116ff_2_1380x174.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F3E0DE\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1855×236 22.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
